{"seq":3,"slug":"firstmile-cost-dashboard","title":"头程成本与到仓时效看板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-firstmile-linehaul/linehaul-ops-exception/firstmile-cost-dashboard","wordCount":2386,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"头程成本与到仓时效看板\">头程成本与到仓时效看板</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>看板是把前三个章节的所有&quot;计划&quot;变成&quot;可度量的结果&quot;的地方。它要回答两个问题：<strong>这批货到底花了多少</strong>（成本），<strong>它按规定的时间到了吗</strong>（时效）。这两个问题看起来简单，但要回答得准确，必须在数据模型上做对三件事：成本要<strong>归集到正确的颗粒度</strong>、时效要<strong>按分段拆解</strong>、两者要能<strong>按同一维度聚合对比</strong>。</p>\n<p>第一件事最容易被做错。头程费用不是一笔海运费，而是一组费用的叠加：海运费、燃油附加费、码头操作费（THC）、报关费、内陆运输费、仓储费、以及异常费用（滞期费、滞留费、改配费）。这些费用来自不同供应商、以不同币种、在不同时间结算。如果系统只记录&quot;这批货总花了 X&quot;，就无法回答&quot;为什么这批比上批贵&quot;——因为看不到费用的结构。</p>\n<p>因此看板的数据基础是一个<strong>费用明细表（cost fact table）</strong>，每一行是一次费用发生，带有费用类型、金额、币种、供应商、以及关联的业务对象（订舱单/柜号/货件）。看板是这张表的不同聚合视图。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[费用明细 fact&lt;br/&gt;订舱/柜/货件 × 费用类型] --&gt; B[按批次聚合&lt;br/&gt;总成本]&#10;  A --&gt; C[按柜聚合&lt;br/&gt;柜均成本]&#10;  A --&gt; D[按费用类型聚合&lt;br/&gt;成本结构]&#10;  B --&gt; E[单位成本&lt;br/&gt;元/kg 或 元/CBM]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; F[异常费用占比]&#10;  G[节点事件 fact] --&gt; H[分段时效]&#10;  H --&gt; I[到仓时效达成率]&#10;  E --&gt; J[成本-时效散点&lt;br/&gt;模式对比]&#10;  I --&gt; J\">graph TD\n  A[费用明细 fact&lt;br/&gt;订舱/柜/货件 × 费用类型] --&gt; B[按批次聚合&lt;br/&gt;总成本]\n  A --&gt; C[按柜聚合&lt;br/&gt;柜均成本]\n  A --&gt; D[按费用类型聚合&lt;br/&gt;成本结构]\n  B --&gt; E[单位成本&lt;br/&gt;元/kg 或 元/CBM]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; F[异常费用占比]\n  G[节点事件 fact] --&gt; H[分段时效]\n  H --&gt; I[到仓时效达成率]\n  E --&gt; J[成本-时效散点&lt;br/&gt;模式对比]\n  I --&gt; J</pre><h2 id=\"成本归集与单位成本\">成本归集与单位成本</h2><p>看板的口径需要与到岸成本的通用定义对齐。到岸成本（Landed Cost）指的是把采购过程中的一切费用加到货物基础成本上，使货物反映其&quot;真实花费&quot;；对进口货物而言，这些费用明确包括<strong>运费、保险、进口关税，以及制造商与零售商之间发生的其他费用</strong>（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Landed_cost\">Landed cost</a>）。头程看板只负责其中的运费段与衍生费用，因此它必须能<strong>单独输出头程段成本</strong>，以便与关税、保险等其他到岸成本项拼接成完整的到岸成本视图——若看板把口径混着算，就无法与财务的到岸成本账对齐。</p>\n<p>成本看板的第一个指标不是总成本，而是<strong>单位成本</strong>——每公斤或每立方的头程成本。原因是总成本无法跨批次比较：一批 5 吨的货花 3 万，另一批 15 吨的货花 6 万，哪批更&quot;贵&quot;？只有换算到单位成本才有可比性。</p>\n<p>单位成本的分母取决于模式：海运整柜用&quot;元/kg 或 元/m³&quot;（取决于货型，重货用 kg、泡货用 m³），海运拼箱用&quot;元/CBM&quot;，空运用&quot;元/kg&quot;。为避免分母用错导致比较失真，应当<strong>同时计算两个单位成本</strong>（元/kg 与 元/m³），并在展示时按货型标注哪个是主要口径。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>unit,kg</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>all</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>gross</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>C</mi><msup><mtext>unit,m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>all</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>cbm</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{unit,kg}} = \\frac{\\sum C_{\\text{all}}}{W_{\\text{gross}}}, \\qquad C_{\\text{unit,m}^3} = \\frac{\\sum C_{\\text{all}}}{V_{\\text{cbm}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unit,kg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3991em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gross</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">all</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5021em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unit,m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7753em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.815em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.334em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.263em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cbm</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">all</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"异常费用必须单独列示\">异常费用必须单独列示</h3><p>上式中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>all</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum C_{\\text{all}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">all</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 包含了异常费用，这会掩盖真实的基础成本水平——一个管理良好的批次与一个频繁甩柜的批次，单位成本差异可能主要来自滞期费而非基础运价。因此看板必须<strong>把异常费用单独列示</strong>，基础成本与异常成本分开看。这也直接对应 <a href=\"rolled-shipment-capacity-exc\">甩柜/舱位异常处置</a> 里的费用敞口模型——那份敞口数据应当与看板的异常费用栏打通。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE firstmile_cost_fact (&#10;  cost_id        bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  shipment_ref   varchar(64) NOT NULL,&#10;  container_no   varchar(11),&#10;  cost_type      varchar(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  is_exception   boolean     NOT NULL DEFAULT false,&#10;  amount         numeric(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  currency       char(3)     NOT NULL,&#10;  amount_cny     numeric(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  vendor         varchar(64),&#10;  incurred_at    date        NOT NULL,&#10;  CONSTRAINT cost_type_known CHECK (cost_type IN (&#10;    &#39;ocean_freight&#39;,&#39;bunker_surcharge&#39;,&#39;thc&#39;,&#39;customs&#39;,&#39;inland&#39;,&#10;    &#39;warehouse&#39;,&#39;demurrage&#39;,&#39;detention&#39;,&#39;rebooking&#39;,&#39;other&#39;))&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 按费用类型聚合，基础成本与异常成本分列&#10;SELECT cost_type,&#10;       SUM(amount_cny) FILTER (WHERE NOT is_exception) AS base_cny,&#10;       SUM(amount_cny) FILTER (WHERE is_exception)     AS exception_cny&#10;FROM firstmile_cost_fact&#10;WHERE incurred_at &gt;= date_trunc(&#39;month&#39;, CURRENT_DATE)&#10;GROUP BY cost_type&#10;ORDER BY base_cny DESC NULLS LAST;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> firstmile_cost_fact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cost_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shipment_ref   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">varchar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  container_no   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">varchar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">11</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cost_type      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">varchar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  is_exception   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">char</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount_cny     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  vendor         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">varchar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  incurred_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cost_type_known </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cost_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'ocean_freight'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bunker_surcharge'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'thc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'customs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'inland'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'warehouse'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'demurrage'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'detention'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rebooking'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'other'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按费用类型聚合，基础成本与异常成本分列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cost_type,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount_cny) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_exception) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_cny,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount_cny) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_exception)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exception_cny</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> firstmile_cost_fact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> incurred_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'month'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, CURRENT_DATE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cost_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_cny </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULLS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LAST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"币种换算的时点必须固定\">币种换算的时点必须固定</h3><p>上例中同时保存 <code>amount</code>（原币）与 <code>amount_cny</code>（折算后），这是必要的——原币是账单凭据，折算值用于聚合。关键是<strong>折算时点必须固定并记录</strong>，通常用费用发生日的汇率。如果每次查看看板都按当日汇率重算，历史数据会随汇率浮动而不断变化，导致&quot;上个月的报表这个月看起来不一样&quot;，无法审计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"到仓时效的分段与达成率\">到仓时效的分段与达成率</h2><p>时效看板的基础是 <a href=\"linehaul-node-transit-track\">国际段节点与干线时效</a> 定义的节点事件。有了统一的节点，就能计算分段时效与达成率。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>目标用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>起运段时长</td>\n<td>工厂交货 → 装船</td>\n<td>供应商与内陆运输考核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干线段时长</td>\n<td>装船 → 到目的港</td>\n<td>船司考核、航线对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清关段时长</td>\n<td>到港 → 放行</td>\n<td>报关行考核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>派送段时长</td>\n<td>放行 → 到仓</td>\n<td>卡车行考核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>到仓达成率</td>\n<td>在承诺期内到仓的比例</td>\n<td>整体 SLA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>到仓 P90 时长</td>\n<td>分位数</td>\n<td>对外承诺设定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"达成率必须用-承诺期-而非-计划期\">达成率必须用&quot;承诺期&quot;而非&quot;计划期&quot;</h3><p>达成率的分子分母定义要谨慎。用&quot;计划期&quot;（订舱时排的计划到仓日）算达成率会失真——计划是系统自己排的，可以排得很宽松从而提高达成率。正确的做法是用<strong>承诺期</strong>（对客户或内部承诺的到仓日），这个日期有对外约束力，不能随意调整。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分段时效揭示的是责任归属\">分段时效揭示的是责任归属</h3><p>分段时效的价值在于把&quot;慢&quot;归到具体的责任方。一次到仓延误 12 天，如果不拆段，只能笼统地说&quot;头程慢&quot;；拆段后可能是&quot;船司慢了 8 天 + 清关慢了 4 天&quot;，这就直接指向两个不同的改进动作（换船司 vs 换报关行）。看板存在的意义正是把模糊的整体指标变成可行动的分段指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本与时效的联合视图\">成本与时效的联合视图</h2><p>成本看板与时效看板分开看会漏掉最重要的信息——<strong>两者的权衡关系</strong>。因此需要一张联合视图，把每个模式（或每条航线、每个承运商）的&quot;平均单位成本&quot;与&quot;P90 时效&quot;画在同一张散点图上，形成一条<strong>效率前沿</strong>：位于前沿上的选项是当前可达到的最优组合，位于前沿右上方的是被支配的选项。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>单位成本（元/kg）</th>\n<th>P90 到仓时长</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>海运整柜</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>长</td>\n<td>前沿左端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海运拼箱</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>较长</td>\n<td>前沿上方（受支配）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铁路</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>前沿中部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卡航</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中短</td>\n<td>前沿中部偏右</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空运</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n<td>短</td>\n<td>前沿右端</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"被支配的选项应当被追问\">被支配的选项应当被追问</h3><p>上表中&quot;海运拼箱&quot;落在前沿上方，意味着在这个具体的对比里，拼箱既比铁路贵、又比铁路慢。这不是说拼箱没用（它的适用货量区间不同），而是说明<strong>若某条航线的拼箱长期被支配，应当重新审视该航线的拼箱策略</strong>——可能是不该开这条拼箱线，也可能是拼箱的时效数据被错误的样本污染了。</p>\n<h3 id=\"看板必须能下钻到单票\">看板必须能下钻到单票</h3><p>聚合指标只能发现异常，不能解释异常。因此看板的每一个聚合值都必须能<strong>下钻到构成它的单票明细</strong>——看到一个航线的 P90 时长变长了，要能点进去看是哪些具体的货件拉长的，再看这些货件在哪个节点停留超常。没有下钻能力的看板，只能报告问题不能定位问题，最终会退化成&quot;定期看一眼的报表&quot;而非决策工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指标的稳定性与告警\">指标的稳定性与告警</h2><p>看板的最后一个设计要点是<strong>区分趋势与噪声</strong>。头程数据样本量小（一个卖家一个月可能只有十几票），单周的指标波动可能完全是噪声。因此：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>指标要有最小样本量门槛</strong>：样本少于阈值时标注&quot;样本不足&quot;，不给达成率结论。</li>\n<li><strong>告警基于趋势而非单点</strong>：连续两周同一分段时效上升才告警，避免被单次异常触发。</li>\n<li><strong>对比要同期</strong>：旺季与淡季的时效天然不同，跨期对比必须注明季节，或使用同比而非环比。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"看板数据的时间对齐\">看板数据的时间对齐</h3><p>成本按费用发生日归集，时效按节点事件日归集，两者的时间轴不一致。做联合分析时必须明确<strong>对齐到哪个维度</strong>——按批次（同一票货的成本与时效绑定）还是按发生月（同月发生的成本与同月到仓的货）。前者适合分析&quot;这批货划不划算&quot;，后者适合分析&quot;这个月的物流支出&quot;。混用会导致数字对不上，这是成本看板最常见的争议来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>看板要回答成本与时效两个问题，数据基础是<strong>费用明细表 + 节点事件表</strong>，看板是它们的聚合视图。</li>\n<li>成本必须用<strong>单位成本</strong>（元/kg 与 元/m³ 双向计算）以便跨批次比较；异常费用必须单独列示，否则会掩盖基础成本水平。</li>\n<li>币种折算时点必须固定并记录，按当日汇率重算历史会让报表不可审计。</li>\n<li>时效指标应<strong>分段计算</strong>（起运/干线/清关/派送）以定位责任方；达成率必须用<strong>承诺期</strong>而非系统自排的计划期。</li>\n<li>成本与时效的<strong>联合散点</strong>形成效率前沿，被支配的选项应被追问；看板必须能下钻到单票明细，否则只能报告问题不能定位问题。</li>\n<li>小样本下要设最小样本量门槛、告警基于趋势而非单点、跨期对比须注明季节或改用同比。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"头程成本与到仓时效看板","id":"头程成本与到仓时效看板"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"成本归集与单位成本","id":"成本归集与单位成本"},{"level":3,"text":"异常费用必须单独列示","id":"异常费用必须单独列示"},{"level":3,"text":"币种换算的时点必须固定","id":"币种换算的时点必须固定"},{"level":2,"text":"到仓时效的分段与达成率","id":"到仓时效的分段与达成率"},{"level":3,"text":"达成率必须用\"承诺期\"而非\"计划期\"","id":"达成率必须用-承诺期-而非-计划期"},{"level":3,"text":"分段时效揭示的是责任归属","id":"分段时效揭示的是责任归属"},{"level":2,"text":"成本与时效的联合视图","id":"成本与时效的联合视图"},{"level":3,"text":"被支配的选项应当被追问","id":"被支配的选项应当被追问"},{"level":3,"text":"看板必须能下钻到单票","id":"看板必须能下钻到单票"},{"level":2,"text":"指标的稳定性与告警","id":"指标的稳定性与告警"},{"level":3,"text":"看板数据的时间对齐","id":"看板数据的时间对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"甩柜/舱位异常处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-firstmile-linehaul/linehaul-ops-exception/rolled-shipment-capacity-exc"},"next":null}